  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Health Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed activity is a five-year transition award to significantly reduce preventable deaths of mothers, newborns, and children. The ihp activity will engage with Ghanas health system stakeholders across public, private, and faith-based sectors to foster improvements in health service access, demand, quality and enabling environment.</narrative>
  </description>
